Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting possible\Nreaching, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.72,0:01:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that I want to\Ntake you to, let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.26,0:01:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together. I'm\Ntelling you, in our path, I trust that it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.86,0:02:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will lead us to another sea, untattered.\NCause now we are home on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,out on the edge of the world\NThere is a place that I want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to take you to Let's head for\Nit then But after the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,we already know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.16,0:02:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,One problem
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.74,0:02:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's death doesn't mean anything\Nto me either way. But I question
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,if she's even the kind of person who\Ncan be killed with guns or cannons
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From my impression of her,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,she's like a giant metal blimp How\Ndo you take someone like that down?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Valid point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We only get one shot at this\Nassassination, and it has to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:03:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what will happen\Nif we're unsuccessful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So emperors, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're that tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.46,0:03:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I kid you not, our lives were at stake\Nwhen we tried to get Brooke back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.22,0:03:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And she was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman previously murdered\Nher own son for some sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.16,0:03:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm curious as to why you chose\Nthe tea party to attempt this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't all of her officers\Nbe in attendance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd ask something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put this bluntly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Under just the right circumstances,\NI can offer in five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fashionable!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard correctly, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.94,0:03:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,However, creating that window of time\Nwill prove to be a bit difficult, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Her pirate crew is not only\Nformidable, but quite substantial, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We will lose complete\Ncontrol of the situation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,if we are noticed by one of her people,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:03:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If that happens, we're\Nlooking at an Alto war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninety-night us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is already in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It all began with the\Ncapture of Caesar here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Gastino and don't you dare call me\Nthat name in front of Big Mom either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen you better make\Ngood on your promise and give
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,me back my heart once we\Naccomplish our goal that's the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,agreement right don't forget\Nand if you're screwing with
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, I won't hesitate to take\Nthe life of your first-born son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My veggies, a man of his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he co. Don't worry,\Nhe always comes through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.96,0:04:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not he go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares what we call him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.10,0:04:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's nothing but human garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.83,0:04:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Still has an important role.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I can't wait to\Nshow you what I've been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Deadly poison gas kx launchers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One's plenty but I made\Nextras because why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.66,0:05:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's five whole grams\Nof organophosphate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.64,0:05:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,in every deadly shot one\Nshot and it's r .i .p
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,rotten poison it's the\Nmost diabolical weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In all existence and it's made by me, mere
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,skin contact can kill\Nalmost any average person
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,just imagine when you\Ninject it in the body
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.86,0:05:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm a hundred no two hundred\Npercent sure you'll die
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll die oh sweet glorious death
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we get the point enough already so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.26,0:05:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you're saying that one shot from this\Nweapon should do the job sadly it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,ain't that simple even if we nail\Nher with it it won't do a damn if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,she's in perfect health the shot alone\Nwill be able to break that woman's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,thick skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, you won't find many weapons\Nthat will work against that broad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what was the point of\Ncreating those launchers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.12,0:06:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't let me finish yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it would be
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,a waste to try when the thing was healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for these to get the job\Ndone, we need to meet Some conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of them, for starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.58,0:06:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to make sure that no\None can stop us for at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.82,0:06:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondly, Mama's gonna need to\Nbe in a weakened state somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.92,0:06:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What a walk in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As it so happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:07:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,everything's gonna line up\Nreal nice at the tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Pez.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Daddy's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.54,0:07:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He can get wildy sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.86,0:07:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a little over a year since\Nwe first allied with Mumsy Woomsies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you forgot to drop the baby talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet we've never seen it take a lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We watched her wreck a whole city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been riddled with bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.36,0:07:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and pelted by cannonballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That bird even sank a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She always walks away without\Na single bruise on her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:08:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You really pegged her when you\Ncompared her to a metal blimp before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that\Nbug-eyed Betty can still
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,get banged up Because I saw\Nit with my own two peepers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.28,0:08:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The incident with Mother\NCarmel's photo, hello
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, Vito
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At every tea party,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,there's this one picture that\Nis placed at the table setting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,directly across from Mama No\None is allowed to sit there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She treats this item like\Nit's some kind of treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a frame with Mother\NCarmel's portrait inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead object is Mama's only known weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So who is that person, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know the details, but\NMama seems indebted to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a mystery, otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think she's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We heard she disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's missing. Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At this Once party,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,a servant accidentally knocked the\Nmother carmel frame off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was completely stunned\Nby Mama's reaction to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Her face went pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And she let out a tremendous\Nshriek like I'd never heard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a much different fit\Nthan her normal hunger pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.50,0:09:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All we could do was cover our ears to\Nprotect ourselves until it was over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so shrill, it even caused\Nsome attendees to pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.90,0:09:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to the scream,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,she unleashed her own conqueror's\NHaki upon the party-goers that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All because someone dropped the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we're just getting to the good part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna believe this but\Nwhen Mama fell down to her knees
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that she scraped them enough
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to bleed they stopped dead in my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,tracks because I thought this\Nmonster didn't bleed red like a human
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,when she breaks down like that her\Nbody loses its defensive properties
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so at the tea party\Ntoday what do you suppose
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,will happen when we\Nsmash that picture that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will be in utter shock and we'll get\Nat least five seconds where everyone will
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,be paralyzed from the cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's the KX Launcher's time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.50,0:11:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And the world will have One less emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The news about the assassination of Big\NMom will spread through the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the screen, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't we be paralyzed as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.74,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The invisible Symphonia system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Earplugs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If just breaking a picture's\Ngonna create such a huge mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,then let's use that time to\Nsave Sanji's family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't gonna be that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We will have approximately three seconds\Nbefore Mama's fit into picture-breaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The man in the thick\Nof it'll be surrounded
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,by angry big mom pirates\Nbefore all the chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Surviving that alone will be no cakewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's the part where\Nyou'll come in, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You up for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just going to\Nuse Luffy to bait them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Veggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Numbi and her friends saved Lola's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't use them like\Nsome kind of sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.22,0:12:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds fun. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.28,0:12:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, can we vote at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we should reevaluate\Nthings before we commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.30,0:12:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,When I show up, it's gonna\Nblow everybody's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.66,0:12:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please elaborate, I'm lost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.10,0:12:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you gonna do a\Nmagic trick or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.32,0:12:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, that'll spoil the surprise. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.96,0:12:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he seems confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a deal, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You better pull this off, boyo. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, so it clear you know when you're\Nsupposed to break the picture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's when Sanji kisses pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not kissing her. Won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone at the whole\Nwedding will turn their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To the kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.46,0:13:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Once her veil is lifted,\Nliterally and figuratively,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding will attempt to shoot Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dodge the bullet, no kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can let the\Ngunshot be your cue. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.10,0:13:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.31,0:13:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go over the plan\Nonce more just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,First, Pudding shoots the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And while everyone's distracted,\NStraw Hat breaks the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom lets out a big scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But that don't bother us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We pull out the invisible symphonia\Nsystem and stick them in our ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just earplugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's like taking candy from a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,While the guests are in a panic, you\Nswoop in and save those Jermagoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we grab the KX launcher,\Nloaded with a poison shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:14:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then send Big Mom to her maker. We\Nwrap everything up in 10 seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stops capiche?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.82,0:14:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we know that big mom's out,\Nthis boob is gonna enter the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.44,0:14:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even to this guy, what did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate that guy! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to work with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.94,0:14:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I can fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll dive onto the scene with a mirror to\Ncreate an easy escape route for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Characterity of her ability,\Nmama's gonna kill me for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't force me to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Capturing Barrel here\Nwas a stroke of genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You did a bang-up job if\Nwe're trying to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,ain't nobody's power gonna\Nbe more useful than hers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon as you finish your dirty work,\Ndive right into Caesar's mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's still gonna be\Nshrieking her head off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So you should have just enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're in the mirror\Ndimension, we can run away safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no quicker and no safer way to\Nget off the island. I guarantee that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be back on the sunny and taking off\Nbefore they even realize what hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the sophisticated plan we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it'll be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sneaky bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Once each of us gets to our own\Nships, the alliance is kaput.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Haul ass out of enemy\Nterritory and don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that everything is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The tea party doesn't kick\Noff until 10 o 'clock, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got two and a half hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better head back to my room for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta move, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's gotta pretend\Nto be security, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.76,0:15:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Veggie, could you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.62,0:15:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so when I make my big\Nfunny entrance, could you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to be funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The day of the tea party, it's a holiday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.78,0:16:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out the beer and supreme cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.02,0:16:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But foul lady put it in a groom already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he's the prince from\Nthe Kingdom of Germany, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.32,0:16:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a strong new ally!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.12,0:16:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire Dufeld conglomerate\Nis here for the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It shall be a star-studded affair,\NI can assure you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To the bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A little too early for that, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. We got more confetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.04,0:16:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sanji's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They said we can't go\Ninside the castle today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping we could escort\Nour prince to the big event.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we are soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.92,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They probably don't want us at a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it should be a day of peace, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello and good morning to\Neveryone in the Vinsmoke family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yonji, wake up and change!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone seen Reiju?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.44,0:17:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not in her room.\NNow that you mention it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've seen her\Nsince yesterday afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's no need to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Reiju is making\Npreparations in another room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I merely wanted to check in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still an hour\Nbefore the tea party?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Mama? Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the ministers now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.14,0:17:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My lovely little skeleton man is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.38,0:17:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's look on the bright side, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.28,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've got the big tea party today\Nthat you've been looking forward to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And you know what that means, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.06,0:17:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The wedding cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I'm pleased to report that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Morgans and the other VIPs have\Nalready arrived on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.26,0:18:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not going to get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You untie me this instant. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.76,0:18:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll leave some food\Nand water, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.26,0:18:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone will come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.86,0:18:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving this land. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you packed all your\Nstuff last night and now
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you're trying to sneak off\Nwithout so much as a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew's an affiliate\Nof the Big Mom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.48,0:18:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you're not\Nallowed to leave the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an open act of\Nbetrayal against Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you even have the guts to face her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.52,0:18:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What good would that do us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.14,0:19:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to leave here and you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how she operates, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe expresses his gratitude to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.92,0:19:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We were very fortunate to\Nhear the truth from Peckums.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.68,0:19:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie's plan to assassinate Big\NMom seems a bit far-fetched to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.40,0:19:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I suppose it's no less\Nsurprising than Mama's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.00,0:19:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,plan to assassinate all of\Nthe Vinsmoke family at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.96,0:19:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, if Luffy finds out about this,\Nhe'll brave any danger to rescue Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The lives of his entire\Ncrew will be at risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot simply sit back\Nand watch them perish
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.64,0:19:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I'm left with no\Nother choice. I must raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,a rebellion I will betray\Nbig mom openly I felt
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the sense of duty to her\Nso I tried telling her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,directly that I wanted\Nto leave but that plan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:20:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,was a failure thanks to\Nthe sacrifice required by
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,her roulette the The\Nnumbers written upon that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,cruel device represented\Nthe lives of my comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.74,0:20:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I need all of\Nyou to flee from this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.14,0:20:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The price that Big Mom required of\Nme was an unreasonable sanction,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,extended far past the\Nvalue of my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day of the tea\Nparty, security will be lax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The hors d 'oeuvre ships will be\Nbusy escorting the guests instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.00,0:20:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And attention will be\Neven further diverted
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,if something shocking\Nhappens at the tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be the perfect chance to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,even with a firm plan\Nthis will be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm prepared for that we\Nsupport you there's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,in this world we want more\Nthan for you to be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you and I know that you\Ndon't get it joining Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,is one thing but you're Too eager\Nto sacrifice yourself for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:21:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is my friend, but I would be\Nproud to call him captain as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.06,0:21:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.96,0:21:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As a pirate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.28,0:21:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,it is my duty and it would be my honor\Nto offer my life to a worthy captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As for when, that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't try to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But while you're saving Straw Hat's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.38,0:21:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,do your best to save\Nyour own life as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone prepare to set\Nsail for Fishman Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ryugu Kingdom is worth\Nfighting for, right? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll protect it,\Nno matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been friends for decades now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll live to see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.82,0:21:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.02,0:22:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jim Bay expresses his gratitude to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he say something to mama\Nthat I don't know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.64,0:22:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I changed my room because you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and I didn't want to sit\Nthrough that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.54,0:22:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that, Yonji?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too fancy for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.90,0:22:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we reach the rooftop,\Nsit still for the tea party.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.36,0:22:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a proud day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.28,0:22:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Germa Double Six will soon\Nregain its former influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.64,0:22:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,With Big Mom's power at our side,\Nwe shall conquer the North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,just as we did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good times for you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.70,0:22:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Assuming Sanji doesn't screw it all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, the groom\Ndidn't run away, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He and the bride are fully prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.76,0:22:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.20,0:22:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you escape like I told you to\Nknow what's going to happen if you stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So depressing getting cold\Nfeet jitters on your big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that sound like pudding to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.34,0:23:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What if that dumbass Sanji\Nbleeds on me after I kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.86,0:23:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.96,0:23:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I want everyone to\Nbelieve I'm a good girl again,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to erase all\Ntheir memories one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.16,0:23:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even imagine that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a major pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.20,0:23:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The players are gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Their objectives are clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.30,0:23:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, at last, the blood-stained\Ntea party shall begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.44,0:24:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody go, it's time to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.72,0:24:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.02,0:24:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.02,0:24:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.90,0:24:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.58,0:24:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's Spokeswagon rushing to the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.96,0:24:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he make it there in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.88,0:24:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the clock strikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.40,0:24:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.62,0:24:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Rockets are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.80,0:24:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't wait to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.50,0:25:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.12,0:26:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Dock. What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.82,0:26:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who invited him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.28,0:26:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so hypocritical.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.42,0:26:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He can see them to a\Nchapel as easy as a grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.66,0:26:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.30,0:26:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can smell the stench of blood on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.72,0:26:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.16,0:26:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't test me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.62,0:26:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what a lovely day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.40,0:26:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful I was asked to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.14,0:26:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.26,0:26:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This marriage is gonna be big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.52,0:26:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And my company has ties to Jen?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.90,0:26:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.38,0:26:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The underworld already knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.14,0:26:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about old news?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.18,0:26:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No one who will care.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.22,0:26:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No one wants a ship old news!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.98,0:26:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So get with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.66,0:26:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.98,0:27:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.64,0:27:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.34,0:27:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Leaders of the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.96,0:27:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.12,0:27:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue through the gate,\Nyou'll sadly be so liggity late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.90,0:27:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But luckily I have a shortcut\Nthat can take you to the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.80,0:27:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A candy escalator.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.70,0:27:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This artwork is a sight to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.98,0:28:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So great. This candy scope is a simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.48,0:28:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Very artistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.18,0:28:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am humbled by your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mama hates late arrivals, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.78,0:28:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's be on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.78,0:28:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the staircase is moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.46,0:28:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather elegant, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.16,0:28:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Convenient?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.08,0:28:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give that. Have a safe trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.02,0:28:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.22,0:28:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can wait for three minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.12,0:28:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,then you'll be free to lick\Nthe candy escalator as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.98,0:28:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time to lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.90,0:29:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It smells lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.84,0:29:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.36,0:29:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This place always with your appetizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.64,0:29:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to see you all! Could make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.00,0:29:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.20,0:29:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I offer you a drink today?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a piece of Mount Maori lava.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.34,0:29:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A beautiful woman who stabbed\Na thousand men and a giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.96,0:29:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds really funny when it screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.52,0:29:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have a cup of the giraffe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.26,0:29:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Same for me. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.88,0:29:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me squeeze it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.14,0:29:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.86,0:29:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, tastes great, and\Nit's smooth going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.64,0:29:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw your body, search,\Nlet me out! Sorry, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.24,0:29:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jigra, no can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.68,0:29:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.32,0:30:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, you damn punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.40,0:30:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Big Mom already inside? You know I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.40,0:30:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,an invitation for the last tea party too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.28,0:30:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But for the life of me i couldn't go
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.28,0:30:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,i had to go to my mother's funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So i would let her as an apology i'm\Njust one guest why should big mom care?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.88,0:30:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do you know what she did?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.14,0:30:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She sent me a box with\Nmy poor sick fat as...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.36,0:31:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that man is a guest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.56,0:31:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who shot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.64,0:31:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.54,0:31:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Street General, Katakuri! Could he?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.86,0:31:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.48,0:31:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what he was gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just one guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.84,0:31:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should Big Mom care?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.36,0:31:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what she did?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.98,0:31:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She sent me a box with my\Npoor sick father's head in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.78,0:31:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here today to finally get my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.62,0:31:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.56,0:31:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.47,0:31:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He fires his gun again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.06,0:32:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Two of your men go down,\Ntaken completely by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.38,0:32:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So I threw a jelly bean at him to stop\Nthat undesirable outcome from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.22,0:32:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.98,0:32:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Rook, Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.58,0:32:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Mama that it was my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.72,0:32:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're gonna say next.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.34,0:32:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.26,0:32:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.70,0:32:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This Bruno, he is going to be\Na pain in the ass at the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.36,0:32:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He trained his observation Haki so\Nmuch he can see into the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.18,0:32:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,for a couple of seconds at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.20,0:32:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's bounty is over a billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.74,0:32:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.66,0:32:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.86,0:32:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.36,0:32:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like the time's arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.32,0:33:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the tea party is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.14,0:33:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why hello there?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.18,0:33:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.20,0:33:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet as far as the eye can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.64,0:33:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So raise those glasses\Nand everybody be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.98,0:33:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.10,0:33:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.30,0:34:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the time of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.92,0:34:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is a very special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.06,0:34:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some wonderful surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.06,0:34:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll knock you off your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.28,0:34:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
